\subsection{Evaluation Metrics}

We employed multiple evaluation metrics to provide comprehensive performance assessment:

\begin{itemize}
\item \textbf{Accuracy:} Overall correctness of predictions
\item \textbf{Precision:} True positives / (True positives + False positives)
\item \textbf{Recall (Sensitivity):} True positives / (True positives + False negatives)
\item \textbf{F1-Score:} Harmonic mean of precision and recall
\item \textbf{Matthews Correlation Coefficient (MCC):} Balanced measure for imbalanced datasets
\item \textbf{Balanced Accuracy:} Average of sensitivity and specificity
\end{itemize}

